      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear that, but isn't there also an argument that these deals are basically necessary for stability? like, if everyone just goes full protectionist and pulls out of treaties to protect their own industries, wouldn't that just cause massive inflation and basically trigger a global economic collapse? seems like the \"national interest\" argument is kind of a trap",
